    "detailed_description": "&quot;Tower of the Abyss&quot; is a strategic casual roguelike game, consisting of a story mode and an infinity mode.<br><br>Use various elements in the game and your luck to advance the story!<br>You can steer the battle to your advantage through manipulation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/Boss_NEW.gif?t=1721567380\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Center of the village, World Tree </h2>The world tree suddenly changes and monsters flock to the peaceful village.<br>It's your job to investigate the World Tree and find out the cause.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/fdc5e77a0bb9552c8e1db3e3c5b9da23.avif?t=1721567380\" width=640 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Resurrection of the Ancient Dragon </h2>The legendary ancient dragon appears.<br>Defeat the ancient dragon to gain mystical effects.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/64e8c3aba1386afe35fb6052ffe6be02.poster.avif?t=1721567380\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/64e8c3aba1386afe35fb6052ffe6be02.webm?t=1721567380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/64e8c3aba1386afe35fb6052ffe6be02.mp4?t=1721567380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Strategic Gameplay </h2>You can use gold to acquire different levels of heroes, combine them into teams, and send them into battle.<br>Complete missions against extreme odds by strategically deploying units and using powerful skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/Unit Draw_NEW.gif?t=1721567380\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Relic </h2>Collect relics to strengthen your heroes and use strategies suited to specific combat situations.<br>By combining relics, you can get even more powerful effects.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/Artifact_NEW.gif?t=1721567380\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Technology </h2>Develop your strategies more efficiently through technology and differentiate your gameplay for more fun.<br>Select a sub-tech and use it strategically according to the situation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/Research_NEW.gif?t=1721567380\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Card </h2>Use various types of strategy cards to lead an advantageous battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/card_NEW.gif?t=1721567380\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Ruins </h2>Explore the ruins to obtain special rewards.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/Ruins_NEW.gif?t=1721567380\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Various Languages \u200b\u200bSupport </h2>Supports English, Korean, Japanese, Chinese, Russian, and German.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Developer's Note </h2>We would appreciate it if you could send us your valuable feedback to the email address below!<br>Developer email: [<a href=\"mailto:dyddyddnr@naver.com\">dyddyddnr@naver.com</a>] or [<a href=\"mailto:wowns226@gmail.com\">wowns226@gmail.com</a>]<br><br>We regularly review the valuable opinions of our users and strive to reflect them as much as possible.<br>Since this is our first game, we are aware that there are many shortcomings.<br>However, we are doing our best to provide the best enjoyment and plan to enhance various aspects before the official release.<br><br>We look forward to receiving more diverse feedback in the future.<br><br>Thank you.",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Tower of the Abyss&quot; is a strategic casual roguelike game, consisting of a story mode and an infinity mode.<br><br>Use various elements in the game and your luck to advance the story!<br>You can steer the battle to your advantage through manipulation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/Boss_NEW.gif?t=1721567380\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Center of the village, World Tree </h2>The world tree suddenly changes and monsters flock to the peaceful village.<br>It's your job to investigate the World Tree and find out the cause.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/fdc5e77a0bb9552c8e1db3e3c5b9da23.avif?t=1721567380\" width=640 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Resurrection of the Ancient Dragon </h2>The legendary ancient dragon appears.<br>Defeat the ancient dragon to gain mystical effects.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/64e8c3aba1386afe35fb6052ffe6be02.poster.avif?t=1721567380\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/64e8c3aba1386afe35fb6052ffe6be02.webm?t=1721567380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/64e8c3aba1386afe35fb6052ffe6be02.mp4?t=1721567380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Strategic Gameplay </h2>You can use gold to acquire different levels of heroes, combine them into teams, and send them into battle.<br>Complete missions against extreme odds by strategically deploying units and using powerful skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/Unit Draw_NEW.gif?t=1721567380\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Relic </h2>Collect relics to strengthen your heroes and use strategies suited to specific combat situations.<br>By combining relics, you can get even more powerful effects.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/Artifact_NEW.gif?t=1721567380\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Technology </h2>Develop your strategies more efficiently through technology and differentiate your gameplay for more fun.<br>Select a sub-tech and use it strategically according to the situation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/Research_NEW.gif?t=1721567380\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Card </h2>Use various types of strategy cards to lead an advantageous battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/card_NEW.gif?t=1721567380\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Ruins </h2>Explore the ruins to obtain special rewards.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709030/extras/Ruins_NEW.gif?t=1721567380\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Various Languages \u200b\u200bSupport </h2>Supports English, Korean, Japanese, Chinese, Russian, and German.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Developer's Note </h2>We would appreciate it if you could send us your valuable feedback to the email address below!<br>Developer email: [<a href=\"mailto:dyddyddnr@naver.com\">dyddyddnr@naver.com</a>] or [<a href=\"mailto:wowns226@gmail.com\">wowns226@gmail.com</a>]<br><br>We regularly review the valuable opinions of our users and strive to reflect them as much as possible.<br>Since this is our first game, we are aware that there are many shortcomings.<br>However, we are doing our best to provide the best enjoyment and plan to enhance various aspects before the official release.<br><br>We look forward to receiving more diverse feedback in the future.<br><br>Thank you.",
    "short_description": "Explore a fantasy 2.5D roguelike game with a unique lineup of heroes and an ancient World Tree at the village's center. Discover diverse items and skills to craft your own strategies as you journey towards the depths of the abyss. Challenge the end of the abyss in this captivating fantasy world.",
